      "body": "### BlogKeeper-文捕\r\n\r\n一款在线博客内容解析下载工具，支持多个平台，多种格式，尽量保留原始文章原始排版\r\n\r\nhttps://www.blog-keeper.com/\r\n\r\n### 🌐**多平台支持**\r\n\r\n+ 微信公众号/博客园/CSDN/掘金/简书/思否\r\n\r\n### 📚多格式导出\r\n\r\n+ HTML（保留原始样式）\r\n+ PDF（适合归档打印）\r\n+ Markdown（便于编辑）\r\n+ MHTML（单文件保存,完整备份，离线浏览）\r\n\r\nblog-keeper主页\r\n![Snipaste_2025-01-15_14-40-44](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28e2d2eb-6f77-438a-a5f9-c19b77c9813a)\r\n\r\n解析\r\n![Snipaste_2025-01-15_14-49-53](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a53a655d-a8e7-4f80-9f20-ec030518aff6)\r\n\r\n文件展示\r\n![Snipaste_2025-01-15_14-54-00](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8341027e-d5fd-483a-a594-cc1349f72881)\r\n\r\nMarkdown展示\r\n![Snipaste_2025-01-15_14-52-18-md](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b88a9ab2-ed06-46cc-910c-00cca989efb7)\r\n\r\nPDF展示\r\n![Snipaste_2025-01-15_14-52-53-pdf](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3af44b4-6152-4a7f-a638-d2273e6ee003)",
